  "evidence": "- TEXT_D (Care/Sanctity): Recruit 27,500 nurses and 4,600 doctors; free personal care for the elderly; restore free dental and eye checks; move toward scrapping prescription charges; Patient Care Guarantees; free off‑peak bus travel for pensioners/disabled; increase basic state pension and support for disabled people; stronger victims’ rights and restorative justice; national doorstep recycling; GM crop moratorium until 2004; at least 10% renewables by 2010 rising annually; phase out nuclear; marine protected areas; replace Climate Change Levy with a carbon tax.\n- TEXT_C (Authority/Loyalty/Sanctity-lite): Withdraw from the EU; enact a UK Bill of Rights; increase police by 25,000 and \"life means life\" for the most serious crimes; increase defence spending and prioritise NATO; exclusive national control of fisheries; increase NHS funding with infection control focus and improved nurse pay; strong GMO labelling/protections; strengthen monitoring of pollution-related health impacts; raise state pension by £5/week; increase elderly care funding.",
